THIRD-PARTY NOTICES

This project contains code derived from the following MIT-licensed work. Its
copyright notice and permission notice are reproduced below, as MIT requires.

1. tanstack-router-keepalive
   https://github.com/hemengke1997/tanstack-router-keepalive
   Copyright (c) hemengke1997
   SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT

   Derived code lives in the `keepalive/` directory of these packages:

     @live-tabs/core              off-screen, cached-route, the event bus, and
                                  the useEventListener / useUpdate hooks
     @live-tabs/tanstack-router   the keep-alive context/provider and the
                                  route renderer
     @live-tabs/next              the keep-alive context/provider, adapted in
                                  turn from the TanStack one
     live-tabs                    all of the above, inlined at build time

   What differs from upstream: the off-screen strategy (CSS visibility rather
   than the Suspense throw-promise pattern), the direct-component render path
   used instead of a frozen `<Outlet />`, the router-agnostic split across
   packages, and the Next.js adapter. See the individual file headers.

